{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"SAGE - Shool Automation and Management System","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg","srcSet":"/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/a9efa/SAGE.jpg 175w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4bdfd/SAGE.jpg 350w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/30dfb/SAGE.avif 175w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/f30ea/SAGE.avif 350w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/83eed/SAGE.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/21ab0/SAGE.webp 175w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/adbff/SAGE.webp 350w,\n/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4d6f8/SAGE.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":329}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express","JavaScript","MySQL","REST API","JWT Authentication"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE-API","external":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE","cta":null},"html":"<p>SAGE is a full-stack <strong>school management system</strong> built to handle <strong>academic and administrative processes</strong>, including student and staff management, attendance control, class schedules, and reporting. It was developed with a modular architecture to ensure scalability, maintainability, and seamless integration with existing school infrastructure.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"ECOTECH – Smart E-Waste Recycling System","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png","srcSet":"/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/9a130/ecotech.png 175w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/a3fa1/ecotech.png 350w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png 700w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/87926/ecotech.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/dae43/ecotech.avif 175w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/d7667/ecotech.avif 350w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/7ec1a/ecotech.avif 700w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/71a30/ecotech.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/5d873/ecotech.webp 175w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/26a00/ecotech.webp 350w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/f23f0/ecotech.webp 700w,\n/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/2c2d0/ecotech.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["React Native","Node.js","Express","Firebase","IoT","Geolocation","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTechAPI","external":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTech","cta":null},"html":"<p>A <strong>smart sustainability system (App + Intelligent Bin)</strong> that connects <strong>IoT-enabled e-waste bins</strong> with an <strong>app</strong> to track electronic waste disposal in real time. Users are identified via CPF, earn points based on waste category and weight, and can view recycling history, analytics, and nearby collection points. We guarantee the profit by an Artificial Inteligence integrated in the <strong>Node.js API</strong> that analyses the <strong>picture captured by the bin's camera</strong> and the <strong>weight</strong>. The system processes sensor data, supports <strong>offline synchronization</strong>, and promotes responsible recycling through data-driven insights.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Nexus Evolution Academy","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png","srcSet":"/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9051f/code.png 175w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/b2c0b/code.png 350w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png 700w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/a4321/code.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/2f9bd/code.avif 175w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/56394/code.avif 350w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/e53cd/code.avif 700w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/6bbde/code.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9b040/code.webp 175w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/18cc4/code.webp 350w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9ed34/code.webp 700w,\n/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/10d45/code.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":373}}},"tech":["React","Java","SpringBoot","JWT Auth","Stripe","Brevo","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/Nexus-Evolution-Academy","external":"#","cta":"#"},"html":"<p>A full-stack <strong>online learning platform</strong> built to handle user authentication, paid courses, and automated communication in a production-ready environment. The platform combines a React frontend with a <strong>Java + Spring Boot</strong> backend, featuring <strong>JWT-based authentication</strong>, Stripe-powered payments, and transactional email automation via Brevo.</p>\n<p>The system was designed with scalability and security in mind, applying <strong>REST API</strong> best practices, clean architecture, and reliable payment workflows. <strong>GenAI</strong> features were integrated to support intelligent platform capabilities and future personalization. The project reflects real-world backend engineering challenges, including secure auth flows, payment lifecycle management, and maintainable domain modeling.</p>"}}]}}}